00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:38,917
For both of us?

286
00:17:38,917 --> 00:17:43,717
Uh, all right.

287
00:17:44,257 --> 00:17:48,337
Being out with a guy at this hour, I guess I'm doing the same.

288
00:17:52,777 --> 00:17:55,057
Well, isn't this great?

289
00:17:55,057 --> 00:18:09,117
I always knew that simpering fool was nothing but a fake.

290
00:18:11,217 --> 00:18:12,397
Never liked her.

291
00:18:12,397 --> 00:18:18,257
Well, come to think of it, I knew that guy Akane was with last night.

292
00:18:19,037 --> 00:18:19,597
He's harmless.

293
00:18:20,157 --> 00:18:20,577
What?

294
00:18:21,717 --> 00:18:23,237
I don't think he remembers me.

295
00:18:24,237 --> 00:18:25,517
But he's just a student.

296
00:18:26,017 --> 00:18:27,377
She tutored him just like me.

297
00:18:28,277 --> 00:18:30,537
I saw them picking out a reference book together once.

298
00:18:31,717 --> 00:18:32,157
And?

299
00:18:32,617 --> 00:18:33,037
What?

300
00:18:33,297 --> 00:18:33,897
What do you mean?

301
00:18:35,057 --> 00:18:36,377
He's just a former student.

302
00:18:36,377 --> 00:18:40,537
He probably just wanted her help, so he called her up last night to talk.

303
00:18:41,917 --> 00:18:42,117
Huh?

304
00:18:45,937 --> 00:18:47,557
Love will make you so blind.

305
00:18:48,257 --> 00:18:49,777
Just a student she tutored?

306
00:18:50,317 --> 00:18:51,237
You're such a fool.

307
00:18:52,037 --> 00:18:52,697
But why?

308
00:18:53,737 --> 00:18:56,117
Why can't he see her for what she really is?

309
00:18:58,337 --> 00:18:58,757
Akane.

310
00:18:58,757 --> 00:18:58,897
Akane.

311
00:19:03,037 --> 00:19:04,437
I guess it makes sense.

312
00:19:04,437 --> 00:19:07,797
We haven't known each other very long.

313
00:19:08,537 --> 00:19:10,797
I just imagined we had some connection.

314
00:19:12,357 --> 00:19:13,217
Poor Mookie.

315
00:19:13,637 --> 00:19:14,597
He loves that woman.

316
00:19:15,717 --> 00:19:16,717
He's a boy.

317
00:19:17,397 --> 00:19:18,357
And his own person.

318
00:19:19,337 --> 00:19:20,117
He's not me.

319
00:19:22,037 --> 00:19:23,477
I can see it now.

320
00:19:25,557 --> 00:19:27,057
As clear as this sky.

321
00:19:29,537 --> 00:19:31,197
Maybe I'm asking too much.

322
00:19:31,197 --> 00:19:34,557
I just want the best for brother, if it's not meant to be me.

323
00:19:35,097 --> 00:19:37,737
Maybe it was an excuse for me to give him up and move on.

324
00:19:39,237 --> 00:19:41,937
But now, I feel something else.

325
00:19:43,957 --> 00:19:45,077
Something seething.

326
00:19:46,517 --> 00:19:47,197
This is...

327
00:19:48,537 --> 00:19:49,597
Miss Minagawa!

328
00:19:49,597 --> 00:19:50,157
Hmm?

329
00:19:56,637 --> 00:19:58,137
This is pure hatred.

330
00:20:01,197 --> 00:20:09,197
Is the guy you were with last night, your boyfriend or something?

331
00:20:16,937 --> 00:20:17,697
Oh no.

332
00:20:18,557 --> 00:20:19,777
He was just a friend.

333
00:20:19,777 --> 00:20:24,137
Not a former student, then?

334
00:20:24,777 --> 00:20:26,137
So if there's...

335
00:20:26,137 --> 00:20:27,057
Nothing between them.

336
00:20:27,637 --> 00:20:28,377
Keep this quiet?

337
00:20:28,857 --> 00:20:29,697
For both of us?

338
00:20:30,437 --> 00:20:32,317
Why does she need to keep it quiet?

339
00:20:33,057 --> 00:20:33,777
Or is it...

340
00:20:34,897 --> 00:20:36,037
She knows something.

341
00:20:36,537 --> 00:20:37,617
We both share someone.

342
00:20:38,337 --> 00:20:41,337
One common person that we don't want to find out about our outings.

343
00:20:43,677 --> 00:20:45,137
And she's realized that?

344
00:20:46,277 --> 00:20:48,257
She's realized I have feelings for brother?

345
00:20:48,257 --> 00:20:52,177
Then what about Mookie's feelings for you?

346
00:20:52,797 --> 00:20:52,957
Hmm?

347
00:20:53,617 --> 00:20:54,517
Is something wrong?

348
00:20:56,157 --> 00:20:56,577
Oh!

349
00:20:57,297 --> 00:20:58,017
Oh no!

350
00:20:58,257 --> 00:20:58,957
Class is starting!

351
00:21:00,477 --> 00:21:01,637
Oh, Miss Hanabi!

352
00:21:01,937 --> 00:21:03,897
Let's talk in the music room after school today.

353
00:21:03,897 --> 00:21:12,557
Just then, Akane took off down the hallway, smelling of cigarettes.

354
00:21:13,437 --> 00:21:18,637
And if I'm not mistaken, wearing the same outfit as yesterday.

355
00:21:18,637 --> 00:21:19,977
I'm going to talk police��ias.

356
00:21:19,977 --> 00:21:20,197
We're so beautiful.

357
00:21:20,197 --> 00:21:20,257
Come out.

358
00:21:20,257 --> 00:21:20,597
Bye.

359
00:21:21,297 --> 00:21:23,257
Bye.

360
00:21:26,037 --> 00:21:27,157
Thank you so much.

361
00:21:27,397 --> 00:21:30,357
Bye-bye.

362
00:21:30,577 --> 00:21:31,337
Bye-bye.

363
00:21:35,657 --> 00:21:36,117
Bye-bye.

364
00:21:36,177 --> 00:21:36,517
Bye.

365
00:21:45,237 --> 00:21:45,577
Bye-bye.

